Runtime services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application makes outbound HTTPS requests to third-party services that it
neither bundles nor licenses: public IP-echo endpoints and an IP-geolocation
provider. These are network services governed by their own terms, not software
distributed with this application. See docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for the list.

